{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"31409c75f8b6e90a76eae9d0bd18dabadf206154b86d1d9bf79cbab1d7b4e947","digest":{"component_or_area":"autodeploy gate / review drain","key_entities":["DEPLOY_DEFER_MAX","REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS","AUTODEPLOY_REVIEW_INTERRUPT","infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh","tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_review_drain.py","infra/terraform/monitoring_autodeploy.tf","DEFER_BOUND_REVIEW_CAP_MULTIPLE"],"problem_keywords":["autodeploy deferral bound","review timeout","interrupt firing","burst pipelining"],"propositions":["DEPLOY_DEFER_MAX bound of 1800s was too tight; four review-interrupt firings on 2026-08-12 overshot by 10s, 20s, 10s, and 130s respectively, each killing an in-flight LLM-Review.","The bound should be raised from 1800s (1.5x REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS) to 2400s (2.0x REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS) to absorb observed overshoots during high-volume landing bursts.","A fixed multiple of the app's per-review cap ensures the bound self-adjusts if REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS is later changed, enforced by test assertions.","The raise absorbs the four documented Aug-12 overshoots but does not address saturated episodes where pipelining itself prevents reviews from draining; those require separate investigation and a drain-signal redesign."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787762965460688001,"uuid":"b5df5c0c-eae3-459a-910d-715b93371c22"}